{
  "_comment": "Who owns which paths, for the three Claudes (owner 2026-11-22). 'lanes' names each lane and its branch prefix; every script reads the lanes from here (scripts/collab_lib.py), so a lane is added by adding it here. Rules are checked top to bottom, the first match wins. owner is a lane name, 'shared' (one claim at a time; every lane that touches it agrees) or 'open' (any lane may claim it). A file owned by lane X and touched by a branch of lane Y needs 'Agree: <branch>' from X, unless the claim is 'Kind: bug' with a Test-first line. 'globs' must each match a file in git; 'planned' globs (files that do not exist yet) count the same but are not checked against git. The split below is the owner's default, written by the coordinator on 2026-11-22; the owner can change it. Merging: any Claude merges its own lane's PRs once they pass CLAUDE.md rule 6; only the coordinator merges the release PR and runs release.yml. Plain rules: docs/process/collaboration.md.",
  "lanes": {
    "coordinator": {
      "prefix": "claude/",
      "name": "Coordinator",
      "description": "The coordinator session and its agents (branches claude/*): unfinished features (gameplay, in-game UI, editor features, rendering, visual scripting, inventory, vehicles, launcher); the Xbox UWP port and our own replacements for third-party code (crypto, the platform layer, model and image readers, WAV and audio decoders, HTTP, okayui, the text editor; handed over from Claude 2 on 2026-11-22); releases (only the coordinator dispatches release.yml), CI and packaging; reviews."
    },
    "claude2": {
      "prefix": "claude2/",
      "name": "Claude 2",
      "description": "Claude 2 (branches claude2/*): bug fixes (any file, with a failing test and a claim marked Kind: bug); physics (engine Physics folders, Ragdoll, ActiveRagdoll, Joint3D); removing duplicate code and the duplicate guard (scripts/dup_lint.py, docs/engine/shared_code.md); the editor main.cpp split."
    },
    "claude3": {
      "prefix": "claude3/",
      "name": "Claude 3",
      "description": "Claude 3 (branches claude3/*): the Build window and game export (BuildPipeline, Build Settings); world, level and chunk streaming, World Partition, LOD and asset streaming (WorldStreamer, Optimize/StreamingGrid); the Steam/Epic Store Kit (Platform/Steam, Platform/Epic, PlatformServices, StoreExport); C# and Lua scripting in the script editor."
    },
    "grok": {
      "prefix": "grok/",
      "name": "Grok",
      "description": "Grok (branches grok/*; owner 2026-11-23, 'agree with grok on 422'): feature-map areas 1 to 4 (docs/feature_map/01-core-scene.md, 02-rendering-world.md, 03-modeling-import.md, 04-characters-cameras.md): improvements, new features and bug fixes (Kind: bug with a failing test first). Each piece is claimed on #422 first; files another lane owns or has an open claim on need an Agree: reply. Our own build tool and compilers (tools/okaybuild, tools/okaycc, tools/okayms) moved to the coordinator's third-party work on 2026-11-23."
    }
  },
